      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kukaba ndoenyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenyi BWANA uchaikaba ndoe, na kuiboya isigho nduu; uchaivurugha na kuwisaghisa wandu wikaiagha andenyi yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mundu uchakabwa. Mkohani uchapatwa ni malagho karakara na wandu; bwana uchapatwa ni malagho karakara na mzumba wake; bibi uchapatwa ni malagho karakara na mwai wake wa kazi. Muuzi uchapatwa ni malagho karakara na mghui; na uo ukopeshagha kara kara na mkopi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoenyi kuchanoneka putu na kumerelwa, kwa kukaia BWANA wajighora ilagho iji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoenyi kwanyaya na kuoma, wurumwengu ghwaawuyasia na kuoma, na mlungunyi kwaawuyasianya na ndoenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoenyi kwanoneka kwa wundu ghwa wandu wake, kwa kukaia warinona sharia na kulegha memu yake; nawo wajichikanya ijo ilaghano ja kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ndoe yamerelwa ni njowe, na wandu waro wapatwa ni wasi kwa wundu ghwa mawiwi ghawo, wandu wa ndoenyi wakorwa hata awo wisigharikagha ni watini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mizabibu iaoma, na divei yapungua. Wandu werechuloghe ni kuboilwa idana wiasoria ngolo kwa wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chwaka ra mayanga ranyamirishiro, na kuboilwa kwa wandu kwasirie; vinubi vawo na misherembe yawo vanyamirishiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie mndungi wawuyanywa divei na kubora; iyo divei ibirie yawawa kwa awo werekoghe wikiinywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzi ghwamerie kuchulwa ni kunoneka, na kula nyumba eemeria kurughwa mndungi usengie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kililo chasikirika chienyi mbaa kwa wundu ghwa kusowa divei, kuboilwa kwawo kwavikia kutua kwaro, kuboilwa kose kwa ndoenyi kwasirie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzi ghoononwa, na mbenge raro rachikanyiro na kunonwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwu niko kutua kwa mbari rose ra ndoenyi kuchaakaia, ni seji zeituni rikuwidwagha na kumerelwa kufuma midinyi, na seji zabibu risholwagha nyuma ya makuwido gharo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wawusira chwaka rawo na kubora kwa kuboilwa; kwa wundu ghwa wubaa ghwa BWANA, wakema kufuma magharibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, mnekenyi BWANA wubaa kufuma mashariki, na wandu wikaiagha masanga gha pwani ndewijikase irina ja BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma kutua kwa ndoenyi, dasikira chumbo ra makaso; ni chumbo remkasa Uo Mhachi. Ela ini nawuyaghamba, “Naawuyasia, ni bugha kwapo naawuyasia! Kwa kukaia Mkalii waawuyanifunya kwa mikalo, waawuyanifunya kwa mikalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiture na vina na midegho vaawuyammbesera inyo wandu wa ndoenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo uchaakimbia kwa wundu ghwa icho kiture, uchachunukia andenyi ya kina, na uo uchajoka kufuma kwa icho kina, uchawadwa ni mdegho. Kwa kukaia vua mbaa yanya kufuma mlungunyi, na misingi ya ndoenyi yasughusika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoe yabarika putu, yawaghanyika, nayo yasughusika na ndighi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoe yazingizika sa mmbongeri, yakumbwakumbwa sa nyumba idukwagha ni kiremba. Ndoe yalemerelwa ni kaung'a rake, nayo ichatota putu hata ndeichaawuka sena anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, BWANA uchakaba majeshi gha roho mbiwi ghiko mbeonyi, na wazuri wa ndoenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichakwanywa chiaimweri kara kara na wafungwa andenyi ya kira, nawo wicharughilwa ahoeni kinenyi, na nyuma ya matuku mengi wichafunywa wipate kukabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aho mori ghuchawuya kira, na iruwa ndejichaafunya miengere yaro anduangi; kwa kukaia BWANA wa majeshi uchabonya nguma aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Sioni na andenyi ya Jerusalemu; nao uchafunukua wubaa ghwake imbiri ya wabaa waro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
